[![African drumming in Caloundra](/media/2013/09/avante-garden-party.jpg)](/?attachment_id=4507) African drumming workshop in Caloundra @ The Avante Garden Party Join Rhythm Culture on Saturday 29th September for a community African drumming workshop at The Avante Garden Party as part of the Caloundra Fringe Festival.  Drums provided or you can bring you own. 4-5pm $5 Ph 0434585992 for more info
